WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:38.160
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:38.240 --> 01:40.800
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

03:26.000 --> 03:26.880
Just leave.

03:27.440 --> 03:29.040
If you break into Cangyan Sea again,

03:29.120 --> 03:30.360
I will not forgive you.

03:30.440 --> 03:31.520
You too.

03:31.600 --> 03:33.640
If you show up again in Shuiyuntian,

03:33.720 --> 03:35.000
I won't go easy on you.

03:35.080 --> 03:37.320
If we meet on the battlefield someday…

03:37.400 --> 03:39.200
We will eventually have a winner.

03:41.520 --> 03:42.360
Yes.

03:43.640 --> 03:45.280
You and I have to settle the score.

03:49.560 --> 03:50.680
I wish

03:51.360 --> 03:53.640
we could go back to the days in Lucheng.

03:59.600 --> 04:00.520
Orchid.

04:01.400 --> 04:02.680
Can I have a word with you?

04:35.080 --> 04:36.440
Do you like Yunmeng Lake?

04:39.560 --> 04:41.080
Of course.

04:41.680 --> 04:43.280
The days we spent together in Lucheng

04:43.840 --> 04:46.320
were so happy.

04:46.400 --> 04:47.960
It was like a dream.

04:52.400 --> 04:53.240
Me too.

04:54.360 --> 04:56.160
When I was Xiao Run in Lucheng,

04:56.800 --> 04:59.200
I had friends and brothers.

04:59.280 --> 05:01.320
I dared to love and hate.
I could follow my heart.

05:01.400 --> 05:03.200
Compared to being Changheng,

05:04.960 --> 05:06.240
being Xiao Run is much better.

05:17.240 --> 05:18.920
In Shuiyuntian,

05:20.600 --> 05:22.280
due to the God of War responsibility,

05:23.160 --> 05:25.240
and also because of my mother's sin
of running away,

05:25.720 --> 05:27.240
I've been abiding by heaven's rules

05:27.320 --> 05:28.920
during all those years.

05:29.000 --> 05:30.440
I dared not take a wrong step.

05:30.520 --> 05:32.440
I couldn't even protect the one I love.

05:33.000 --> 05:34.400
I could only keep her in my heart.

05:36.000 --> 05:37.400
When I was in Lucheng,

05:37.960 --> 05:39.160
I finally realized

05:41.920 --> 05:43.440
what I really want.

06:07.200 --> 06:08.200
Orchid.

06:08.800 --> 06:10.800
When I was Xiao Run,

06:10.880 --> 06:13.080
I made many vows to you.

06:13.640 --> 06:15.560
All my words were sincere.

06:16.040 --> 06:17.480
Even if I'm Changheng now,

06:19.520 --> 06:20.440
they still count.

06:22.800 --> 06:24.680
Before I transformed,

06:25.240 --> 06:27.080
my immortal root was ruined by my master.

06:27.680 --> 06:29.640
It was you who pleaded for me.

06:30.240 --> 06:32.240
So my master kept me.

06:33.240 --> 06:35.320
You saved my life.

06:35.840 --> 06:36.880
But…

06:37.800 --> 06:39.640
I was ignorant

06:39.720 --> 06:41.200
and knew nothing of the world.

06:42.120 --> 06:44.720
I didn't know there were various feelings
in this world.

06:48.000 --> 06:49.800
My affection for you…

06:50.760 --> 06:53.600
is gratitude and appreciation.

06:54.680 --> 06:56.280
It's not the affection

06:59.520 --> 07:01.760
that can make my heart sour and painful.

07:02.680 --> 07:04.720
It's not the affection
that can still survive and blossom

07:05.920 --> 07:08.200
even though it's crushed.

07:14.840 --> 07:15.880
Lord Changheng.

07:18.640 --> 07:19.800
Please take this back.

07:51.040 --> 07:52.160
You don't even want

07:53.360 --> 07:54.960
to keep it as a souvenir?

07:58.280 --> 08:00.240
Please give it to your fated one.

08:29.480 --> 08:30.560
What did you talk about?

08:42.320 --> 08:44.120
He's gone. Stop staring.

08:44.880 --> 08:45.880
Let's go.

08:48.680 --> 08:50.000
I've been standing for too long.

08:50.080 --> 08:52.720
My legs are sore. I can't walk anymore.

08:59.400 --> 09:00.320
Can't walk?

09:13.640 --> 09:14.960
Put me down!

09:15.040 --> 09:15.920
No.

09:18.920 --> 09:21.040
- What were you talking about?
- I'm not telling you.

09:40.960 --> 09:41.840
Lord Xunfeng.

09:43.800 --> 09:44.760
Shangque.

09:47.840 --> 09:49.160
What's the matter, Lord Xunfeng?

09:51.160 --> 09:52.320
After I went back,

09:53.000 --> 09:54.120
I was worried every night.

09:55.240 --> 09:57.160
Is there a way

09:57.240 --> 09:58.840
that can lift my brother's
One Heart Curse?

10:03.120 --> 10:05.440
If I knew it, would I hurt my brother?

10:05.520 --> 10:06.640
Of course you won't.

10:06.720 --> 10:09.240
Then why are you hesitating?

10:10.760 --> 10:12.080
Actually,

10:12.880 --> 10:14.880
the only way to break the curse

10:16.000 --> 10:18.000
is to kill Orchid

10:18.080 --> 10:19.720
with the ancient Chengying Sword.

10:20.360 --> 10:21.680
But as you know,

10:21.760 --> 10:23.760
I've been searching for it
in the three realms.

10:23.840 --> 10:25.520
But I still couldn't find
the last fragment.

10:25.600 --> 10:27.320
Even if we know how to lift the curse,

10:27.400 --> 10:28.440
it's useless.

10:30.520 --> 10:33.000
So that's why you searched

10:33.640 --> 10:35.840
for the fragments of Chengying Sword.

10:35.920 --> 10:37.120
Yes.

10:40.080 --> 10:41.360
Lord Xunfeng.

10:43.280 --> 10:45.080
Have you found the last fragment?

10:47.280 --> 10:48.160
No.

10:58.640 --> 10:59.760
Have a look.

11:00.320 --> 11:01.600
Come and have a look.

11:03.480 --> 11:05.040
Pretty love locks. Take a look.

11:05.120 --> 11:06.240
Love locks.

11:06.760 --> 11:08.680
Hi, have a look at the love locks.

11:08.760 --> 11:09.720
They are very lovely.

11:11.520 --> 11:12.360
Look at them.

11:13.080 --> 11:14.520
Are they good? Have a look.

11:14.600 --> 11:16.280
Pretty love locks.

11:16.360 --> 11:17.560
Take a look.

11:17.640 --> 11:18.680
Love locks.

11:19.360 --> 11:22.000
- Look at them.
- Why are there so many love lock sellers?

11:22.080 --> 11:23.720
The streets are lively too.

11:24.480 --> 11:25.400
Yes.

11:25.480 --> 11:26.360
Seven days later

11:26.440 --> 11:28.840
is the Mountain and Moon Festival
of once in a thousand years.

11:28.920 --> 11:30.040
Mountain and Moon Festival?

11:32.040 --> 11:34.320
Do you see the moon-shaped mountain?

11:34.400 --> 11:35.400
Every 1,000 years,

11:35.480 --> 11:36.840
the full moon in Cangyan Sea

11:36.920 --> 11:38.080
will meet it.

11:38.920 --> 11:40.320
By then,

11:40.400 --> 11:43.160
the full moon will be fully inserted
in the mountain.

11:43.240 --> 11:44.960
If they meet,

11:45.040 --> 11:47.000
will it be a bigger full moon?

11:47.080 --> 11:48.720
This is the origin of the festival.

11:49.760 --> 11:52.840
What does it have to do
with buying the love locks?

11:52.920 --> 11:55.280
Why does everyone buy the locks?

11:55.360 --> 11:56.680
I don't know.

11:56.760 --> 11:58.680
Maybe it's a new custom

11:58.760 --> 12:00.560
in the past 30,000 years here.

12:02.240 --> 12:03.600
- Jieli.
- Orchid.

12:05.000 --> 12:06.280
My lord.

12:06.360 --> 12:09.000
Well, no wonder
I haven't seen you all day.

12:09.080 --> 12:10.600
So you went on a date with the lord.

12:13.680 --> 12:14.560
Jieli.

12:15.840 --> 12:16.880
My lord.

12:20.240 --> 12:21.760
What are these?

12:21.840 --> 12:23.160
You bought two locks?

12:24.960 --> 12:26.920
Why did you buy them?

12:27.800 --> 12:28.920
You have no idea, my lord.

12:29.400 --> 12:30.600
It is said that

12:30.680 --> 12:32.400
if couples who are in love

12:32.480 --> 12:35.040
carve each other's name on the love lock,

12:35.120 --> 12:36.840
and hang them on the bridge of love

12:36.920 --> 12:39.720
on the night
of the Mountain and Moon Festival

12:39.800 --> 12:41.160
when the mountain and moon meet,

12:42.680 --> 12:44.920
then they will be…

12:48.280 --> 12:49.480
What will they be?

12:52.040 --> 12:54.600
They will be together forever and ever.

13:09.400 --> 13:11.320
Really?

13:13.560 --> 13:14.760
It's just nonsense.

13:14.840 --> 13:17.680
It's just some groundless saying
without evidence.

13:18.240 --> 13:19.800
It's not strained at all.

13:19.880 --> 13:21.200
How wonderful it is.

13:21.280 --> 13:23.120
I won't be interested in those activities

13:23.200 --> 13:24.920
to cheat kids.

13:25.520 --> 13:27.240
Neither am I.

13:27.320 --> 13:31.080
So the Mountain and Moon Festival
is the lovers' festival

13:31.160 --> 13:32.640
in Cangyan Sea every 1,000 years?

13:33.200 --> 13:34.600
I grew up in Haishi.

13:34.680 --> 13:35.680
I didn't even know

13:35.760 --> 13:37.440
there was such a festival
in the Moon Tribe.

13:37.520 --> 13:38.800
I almost missed it.

13:42.680 --> 13:43.880
Shangque.

13:43.960 --> 13:46.360
Are you available on the day
of the Mountain and Moon Festival?

13:48.040 --> 13:50.640
I wonder if you have
any instructions that day, my lord?

13:50.720 --> 13:53.040
My lord, please lend me Shangque

13:53.120 --> 13:54.680
at the Mountain and Moon Festival.

14:01.720 --> 14:02.720
Approved.

14:02.800 --> 14:04.400
- Thank you, my lord.
- Thank you, my lord.

14:04.480 --> 14:05.440
Great.

14:05.520 --> 14:06.720
Let's go.

14:08.720 --> 14:09.560
Come on.

14:16.800 --> 14:17.840
I'll look around.

14:28.760 --> 14:29.760
Look at those merchants.

14:29.840 --> 14:31.880
They are not good
at doing business at all.

14:31.960 --> 14:33.360
They're all selling locks.

14:33.440 --> 14:34.800
How much can they earn?

14:35.760 --> 14:37.360
Let's set up a stall

14:37.440 --> 14:40.000
to sell sharp gravers.

14:41.520 --> 14:42.880
What?

14:42.960 --> 14:43.840
Think about it.

14:43.920 --> 14:45.120
On the day of the festival,

14:45.200 --> 14:47.920
almost all lovers
in Cangyan Sea will come.

14:48.000 --> 14:49.320
So all of them

14:49.400 --> 14:51.280
will be our potential buyers.

14:52.560 --> 14:54.160
By then,

14:55.160 --> 14:57.600
we can also sell some rouge,
cosmetics, and ornaments

14:58.480 --> 14:59.680
at a high price.

15:00.360 --> 15:02.000
In such a romantic atmosphere,

15:02.080 --> 15:04.800
men will not hesitate
to spend money on women.

15:05.720 --> 15:07.800
You'll be in charge of purchasing
and running errands.

15:07.880 --> 15:09.600
I'll be responsible
for attracting customers.

15:09.680 --> 15:11.160
We'll make a fortune.

15:12.040 --> 15:13.760
- I'm going to be rich.
- So you're not going…

15:15.560 --> 15:17.280
to admire the moon with me?

15:17.360 --> 15:18.840
Are you crazy?

15:18.920 --> 15:21.120
How can you miss the chance to earn money?

15:24.520 --> 15:25.520
Don't worry.

15:25.600 --> 15:27.200
Your benefits are guaranteed.

15:27.280 --> 15:29.320
If you come to help me,

15:29.400 --> 15:32.080
I'll give you 10% of the profit.

15:34.760 --> 15:36.480
What? Is it too little?

15:37.800 --> 15:38.920
Then 15% of the profit.

15:40.680 --> 15:42.040
That's not what I mean.

15:42.600 --> 15:43.800
20%.

15:44.520 --> 15:46.480
You're still not satisfied?

15:46.560 --> 15:47.680
Black Dragon!

15:54.800 --> 15:56.400
- Boss.
- You want to buy the lock?

15:56.480 --> 15:58.320
Show me your most beautiful locks.

15:58.400 --> 15:59.920
They are all here. Pick one.

16:00.800 --> 16:02.200
So beautiful.

16:04.240 --> 16:05.520
So nice.

16:22.160 --> 16:23.720
Sir, do you want a lock?

16:26.120 --> 16:27.520
What kind of locks do you want?

16:27.600 --> 16:28.760
Lower your voice.

16:33.120 --> 16:34.640
The style doesn't matter.

16:34.720 --> 16:36.800
I want the hardest and strongest one.

16:37.360 --> 16:38.560
All right, I got it.

16:38.640 --> 16:40.000
The stronger, the better.

16:40.080 --> 16:41.080
All right.

16:41.160 --> 16:42.320
I'll take this.

16:42.400 --> 16:43.320
No.

16:49.040 --> 16:50.880
- I'll take these two.
- All right.

16:51.920 --> 16:53.080
They cost one stone.

16:55.120 --> 16:55.960
See you.

17:03.120 --> 17:04.079
Here.

17:05.480 --> 17:07.359
Please take a look.

17:10.079 --> 17:12.480
Love locks. Top-grade love locks.

17:50.120 --> 17:55.680
ORCHID

17:58.680 --> 18:02.240
ORCHID

18:16.680 --> 18:17.560
Moon Supreme.

18:18.280 --> 18:19.240
What is it?

18:20.520 --> 18:22.760
Since the fairy is related to your life,

18:23.320 --> 18:24.520
she should be strictly guarded.

18:24.600 --> 18:25.800
Nothing must go wrong.

18:26.960 --> 18:29.160
Why do you still

18:29.840 --> 18:30.880
take her around?

18:32.120 --> 18:34.400
Why do you indulge her so much?

18:35.560 --> 18:37.320
As long as I am with her,

18:37.400 --> 18:38.840
how can things go wrong?

18:41.160 --> 18:42.400
Moon Supreme.

18:43.800 --> 18:44.960
You can't use Hellfire now.

18:46.480 --> 18:47.720
You're not like before.

18:57.320 --> 18:59.600
I will recover in a few days.

18:59.680 --> 19:01.600
And my Hellfire will be recovered soon.

19:04.800 --> 19:05.680
Moon Supreme.

19:07.320 --> 19:10.040
That fairy will be a disaster
sooner or later.

19:10.960 --> 19:12.880
Since you know how to break the curse,

19:12.960 --> 19:16.000
why don't you reforge the Chengying Sword
and kill her to prevent any trouble?

19:23.680 --> 19:26.440
Not to mention the last piece
of Chengying Sword couldn't be found.

19:26.520 --> 19:28.320
Even if it's successfully reforged,

19:28.400 --> 19:30.600
I won't kill my beloved one.

19:30.680 --> 19:32.040
Beloved one?

19:33.520 --> 19:34.920
You keep saying you're remorseful

19:35.000 --> 19:36.960
toward the 100,000 soldiers
in Xuanxu Realm.

19:37.880 --> 19:39.920
But now you're turning the culprit

19:40.000 --> 19:41.720
as the one you love!

19:41.800 --> 19:43.440
She is not the culprit,

19:47.320 --> 19:48.520
but me.

20:04.280 --> 20:06.360
The primordial spirit of Lady Chidi
has been destroyed.

20:07.200 --> 20:10.040
I will find another way to unseal them.

20:10.600 --> 20:11.920
At this point,

20:12.480 --> 20:15.360
I will do my best
to help you find another way.

20:17.040 --> 20:18.800
But no matter what,

20:18.880 --> 20:21.280
the people of the Moon Tribe and I

20:21.760 --> 20:25.360
will never agree to our Moon Supreme
being with a fairy who brings disaster.

20:34.160 --> 20:37.640
LUCHENG, YUNMENG LAKE

20:45.680 --> 20:48.040
On the day you and Lady Chidi
completed your hardships,

20:48.120 --> 20:50.160
Ronghao used the evil qi to trap me.

20:50.240 --> 20:51.560
Ronghao?

20:52.800 --> 20:53.720
You mean

20:53.800 --> 20:56.200
the evil qi that hurt you
was from Ronghao?

20:56.280 --> 20:57.520
Yes.

20:59.240 --> 21:00.080
Are you sure?

21:00.160 --> 21:01.680
Of course.

21:01.760 --> 21:04.520
Ronghao must have close ties
with the Lord of Haishi.

21:06.320 --> 21:07.200
Yes.

21:07.280 --> 21:10.000
The Lord of Haishi captured me
in the Thousand Dreamland

21:10.080 --> 21:11.680
and made an illusion of the Arbiter Hall.

21:11.760 --> 21:14.240
He pretended to be Lord Changheng
and made me fix the Destiny Book.

21:14.320 --> 21:15.960
He must have been to Shuiyuntian.

21:16.040 --> 21:19.080
Otherwise, how could he be so familiar
with the Arbiter Hall?

21:19.160 --> 21:21.040
And he was so good
at imitating Lord Changheng.

21:21.120 --> 21:22.440
It was so alike.

21:22.920 --> 21:25.400
Could it be that Lord Ronghao told him?

21:55.280 --> 21:58.400
CRANE PAVILION

22:16.320 --> 22:17.320
You're here.

22:18.280 --> 22:19.760
I've been waiting for you for three days.

22:20.520 --> 22:22.000
I knew you would find me.

22:23.240 --> 22:24.720
I wonder who is the one

22:24.800 --> 22:25.920
waiting for me?

22:26.880 --> 22:28.240
Is it that carefree

22:28.320 --> 22:30.200
and open-minded Lord Ronghao,

22:30.280 --> 22:31.800
or the Lord of Haishi,

22:31.880 --> 22:33.440
who is cunning and plays tricks

22:34.040 --> 22:36.440
in order to manipulate the Fairy Realm

22:40.800 --> 22:41.880
and the Moon Tribe?

22:49.040 --> 22:51.000
When did you start suspecting me?

22:53.640 --> 22:55.080
I never suspected you.

22:56.040 --> 22:57.000
I don't know

22:58.640 --> 23:01.280
how you got the evil qi
to trap Dongfang Qingcang.

23:02.480 --> 23:05.240
And why the Lord of Haishi
who has never been to Shuiyuntian

23:05.800 --> 23:07.320
turned into me

23:07.800 --> 23:09.560
and created a fake Arbiter Hall

23:09.640 --> 23:11.200
to deceive Orchid.

23:11.280 --> 23:12.600
How do you explain

23:13.120 --> 23:14.440
all these things?

23:33.600 --> 23:34.800
Why?

23:36.680 --> 23:37.880
That day,

23:38.920 --> 23:41.360
when you insisted
on saving Orchid in Cangyan Sea,

23:42.320 --> 23:43.880
you should have known the answer.

23:51.560 --> 23:53.360
If I had a chance to save my master,

23:55.240 --> 23:56.680
what do you think I would do?

23:58.000 --> 23:59.880
You would fight to the death.

24:00.360 --> 24:01.920
Even if you must turn against everyone

24:02.520 --> 24:04.040
or defy the laws of heaven,

24:05.600 --> 24:06.840
you would not hesitate.

24:11.520 --> 24:13.400
Do you know where this place is?

24:18.960 --> 24:20.120
Once,

24:21.120 --> 24:23.000
there was a mortal child.

24:23.640 --> 24:25.040
He was born blind.

24:25.120 --> 24:26.680
He had no parents.

24:26.760 --> 24:28.520
He could only make a living

24:28.600 --> 24:30.320
by playing the flute.

24:32.080 --> 24:33.280
That year,

24:33.960 --> 24:35.600
the winter in Yunmeng Lake

24:36.880 --> 24:37.760
was freezing cold.

24:48.800 --> 24:53.440
TAITANG INN

24:53.520 --> 24:54.640
That blind child

24:55.160 --> 24:57.160
hadn't found food for three days.

24:58.160 --> 24:59.880
His body was freezing.

25:01.640 --> 25:03.480
Only his fingers could move.

25:04.840 --> 25:06.280
He sat there,

25:07.160 --> 25:10.720
blowing the flute.

25:13.760 --> 25:14.960
Gradually,

25:16.120 --> 25:17.560
he lost consciousness.

25:19.600 --> 25:22.160
He thought he might be frozen to death.

25:27.320 --> 25:29.080
But when he woke up,

25:30.120 --> 25:31.760
he saw a person.

25:33.520 --> 25:34.560
Yes.

25:35.960 --> 25:37.280
He could see the world.

25:42.040 --> 25:43.640
The first thing he saw

25:45.040 --> 25:46.840
was a very dazzling

25:47.840 --> 25:49.120
and beautiful lady.

25:50.840 --> 25:52.280
But she looked

25:53.080 --> 25:54.840
so sad.

26:00.040 --> 26:01.120
That blind child

26:02.640 --> 26:03.560
was you?

26:04.880 --> 26:06.160
Before I met my master,

26:07.240 --> 26:09.000
I lived in endless darkness.

26:10.040 --> 26:11.680
After my master died,

26:12.480 --> 26:15.360
she took away
all the brightness in my heart.

26:15.920 --> 26:17.320
There's only a hollow skin left.

26:18.160 --> 26:19.440
To revive her,

26:20.920 --> 26:24.200
I became a hollow-minded being
who only knows to kill and fight.

26:28.040 --> 26:29.840
And the Lord Ronghao you know

26:30.480 --> 26:32.840
who is easy-going

26:33.400 --> 26:34.600
and carefree

26:35.280 --> 26:38.360
is just a mirage outside this body.

26:39.880 --> 26:42.240
Did you really kill

26:43.000 --> 26:44.800
the 3,000 soldiers?

26:45.440 --> 26:46.320
That day,

26:47.440 --> 26:49.840
though I could save half
of the primordial spirit of my master,

26:50.360 --> 26:52.240
the 30,000 years of tribulation

26:53.040 --> 26:56.160
made her fragile primordial spirit
even weaker.

26:56.720 --> 26:57.960
Only the evil qi

26:58.480 --> 27:00.200
could stabilize her primordial spirit.

27:02.800 --> 27:04.640
So I set up Haishi

27:05.680 --> 27:07.680
and instigated the internal strife
of the Moon Tribe

27:07.760 --> 27:10.880
to absorb plenty of spirits
of the Moon Tribe

27:10.960 --> 27:12.280
and refine the evil qi.

27:14.680 --> 27:17.440
But after Dongfang Qingcang returned
to Cangyan Sea,

27:18.560 --> 27:20.560
I couldn't do anything to the Moon Tribe.

27:24.600 --> 27:25.880
I could only…

27:25.960 --> 27:28.280
The former God of War was upright

27:29.480 --> 27:31.120
and tried her best to protect the people.

27:31.200 --> 27:32.480
If she knew

27:32.560 --> 27:35.000
you kept killing your fellows
for her resurrection,

27:35.480 --> 27:36.760
how would she feel?

27:36.840 --> 27:38.120
People?

27:42.080 --> 27:44.080
How can the people compare to her?

27:45.440 --> 27:47.080
I just want my master
to come back to life.

27:47.160 --> 27:49.400
As long as I can see her again,

27:50.760 --> 27:52.880
even if she kills me,

27:52.960 --> 27:54.320
I'll feel no regrets.

28:05.560 --> 28:07.160
We've known each other for 10,000 years.

28:08.720 --> 28:10.520
You were my best friend.

28:11.200 --> 28:12.880
But now I realize

28:13.360 --> 28:15.320
I know nothing about you.

28:17.440 --> 28:19.080
How foolish I am.

28:22.360 --> 28:23.960
For the past 30,000 years,

28:25.040 --> 28:26.680
on each anniversary of my master's death,

28:27.560 --> 28:29.840
I would go to the monument
to pay my respects.

28:32.160 --> 28:34.600
And the only person I met there

28:37.960 --> 28:39.000
was you.

28:42.560 --> 28:43.520
Changheng.

28:45.080 --> 28:46.320
For the past 30,000 years,

28:47.960 --> 28:49.200
I've been disguising

28:50.240 --> 28:51.600
and lying.

28:53.920 --> 28:56.200
But being friends with you
is something I did

28:57.720 --> 28:59.080
from the bottom of my heart.

29:05.760 --> 29:06.760
I trust you.

29:09.120 --> 29:10.400
I know you trust me too.

29:12.000 --> 29:14.080
In order to save Orchid,

29:14.160 --> 29:15.920
you are isolated and betrayed by others.

29:16.520 --> 29:18.120
You and I are the same.

29:18.200 --> 29:19.240
Otherwise,

29:20.360 --> 29:22.280
how could we be friends?

29:22.840 --> 29:24.560
But you've committed a crime.

29:26.400 --> 29:27.800
Your sin is unforgivable.

29:30.360 --> 29:31.240
Let's go.

29:32.000 --> 29:33.200
I'll go back with you.

29:50.320 --> 29:51.280
Li Yuan.

29:53.640 --> 29:54.520
Yes, Your Majesty.

29:54.600 --> 29:56.600
The matter of the sinner Ronghao

29:56.680 --> 29:58.240
is related to the three realms.

29:58.320 --> 30:00.880
Each of his sins is horrifying.

30:00.960 --> 30:03.240
He needs to be interrogated carefully.

30:05.280 --> 30:07.400
Put him in the Karma Jail for now.

30:07.480 --> 30:09.720
You are tasked to guard him strictly.

30:09.800 --> 30:11.080
Don't let anything go wrong.

30:11.160 --> 30:12.360
Yes.

30:40.400 --> 30:43.520
Although you committed a serious crime
for the sake of a traitor,

30:44.400 --> 30:46.880
you did a great job catching
the criminal, Ronghao.

30:46.960 --> 30:48.360
She is not a traitor.

30:49.640 --> 30:51.600
At this point, you are still stubborn

30:51.680 --> 30:53.240
and disregarding the overall situation.

30:53.320 --> 30:54.360
The overall situation

30:57.760 --> 30:59.640
is just your big picture.

31:00.600 --> 31:01.960
In your eyes,

31:02.040 --> 31:03.320
our mother and I,

31:03.400 --> 31:04.920
and your closest relatives,

31:05.840 --> 31:08.440
are all chess pieces in your big picture.

31:08.520 --> 31:09.720
You…

31:09.800 --> 31:11.680
Why are you still pretending?

31:13.360 --> 31:15.600
The power of heaven
is like millions of soldiers.

31:15.680 --> 31:17.000
At the Oblivion River,

31:17.080 --> 31:19.000
I have openly defied you.

31:19.480 --> 31:20.920
If you didn't kill me,

31:21.480 --> 31:23.440
how would you rule the Fairy Realm
in the future?

31:23.520 --> 31:24.640
Besides,

31:25.160 --> 31:26.800
if I die,

31:26.880 --> 31:28.560
you can completely get rid of the shame

31:28.640 --> 31:31.240
of our mother's sin of running away.

31:31.320 --> 31:32.920
Isn't that a win-win situation?

31:34.200 --> 31:35.640
Changheng.

31:36.560 --> 31:39.720
Do you really think I won't kill you?

31:42.040 --> 31:43.320
Since I'm back,

31:43.920 --> 31:45.240
I'm ready to be killed.

31:46.240 --> 31:48.600
Just for a traitor
who colluded with the Moon Tribe,

31:48.680 --> 31:50.920
do you truly desire to die?

31:51.000 --> 31:52.560
She's not a traitor!

31:58.800 --> 32:00.800
I have been obeying the rules
since childhood.

32:02.240 --> 32:03.480
My long life

32:03.960 --> 32:06.280
is like the frozen Northernmost Ocean

32:06.960 --> 32:07.960
without waves.

32:08.840 --> 32:10.280
Only when I met Orchid

32:10.360 --> 32:12.200
did my world have colors.

32:12.280 --> 32:14.160
Now she has someone in her heart

32:15.200 --> 32:16.760
and is willing to stay in Cangyan Sea.

32:17.720 --> 32:18.960
The rest of my life is too long.

32:19.040 --> 32:22.360
I really don't know how to spend my days.

32:24.520 --> 32:25.880
Only after I die,

32:27.360 --> 32:29.200
can you defend your authority.

32:45.120 --> 32:46.640
In the three realms,

32:47.600 --> 32:48.760
only you

32:49.520 --> 32:52.000
can compete with that Dongfang Qingcang.

32:54.080 --> 32:56.120
You are the God of War of Shuiyuntian.

32:56.600 --> 32:58.680
How can you abandon your duties?

32:59.960 --> 33:00.840
Changheng.

33:01.600 --> 33:03.680
As long as you admit your mistake to me

33:03.760 --> 33:05.240
- and be punished in front of--
- No need.

33:09.000 --> 33:10.720
I'm tired of war.

33:12.000 --> 33:13.280
From now on,

33:14.720 --> 33:16.720
I won't fight for you anymore.

33:21.800 --> 33:22.880
Fine.

33:24.120 --> 33:25.360
I…

33:26.560 --> 33:28.120
grant your wish.

33:39.640 --> 33:40.720
Before I came here,

33:40.800 --> 33:42.640
I saw Changheng's destiny in this life.

33:42.720 --> 33:44.360
Changheng's tribulation

33:44.840 --> 33:46.320
is not to kill Xie Wanqing.

33:47.080 --> 33:48.320
In this life,

33:48.840 --> 33:50.840
he dies to save the one he cares about.

33:52.680 --> 33:54.800
Lord Changheng has successfully
experienced hardship.

33:55.360 --> 33:57.280
It meant I was the one he cared about.

33:59.240 --> 34:02.320
But the one he cared about was Cricket,

34:02.400 --> 34:03.560
not Danyin.

34:04.360 --> 34:05.240
Besides,

34:06.040 --> 34:08.840
Lord Changheng loves Orchid.

34:12.080 --> 34:15.400
One of the two weddings
Tianji Mirror predicted has come true.

34:16.239 --> 34:18.320
Will the second wedding come true as well?

34:19.760 --> 34:20.960
If he knows that Orchid

34:21.040 --> 34:23.480
might be the Goddess of Xishan

34:23.560 --> 34:25.159
who is his fiancée…

34:26.000 --> 34:27.400
Should I tell him?

34:28.480 --> 34:29.920
If I tell him,

34:30.760 --> 34:32.120
there will be no turning back.

34:33.199 --> 34:34.920
They will definitely get married.

34:35.960 --> 34:37.560
But if I don't tell him,

34:37.639 --> 34:40.080
no one will know that Orchid
is the goddess.

34:41.199 --> 34:43.360
Will Lord Yunzhong punish Lord Changheng

34:43.440 --> 34:44.880
for committing a crime of collusion?

34:46.320 --> 34:48.639
He'll have to be sent
to the Immortal Slaying Pavilion.

34:51.480 --> 34:52.440
Not necessarily.

34:53.199 --> 34:55.000
After all, they are siblings.

34:55.080 --> 34:56.880
Lord Yunzhong will care about his sibling.

34:56.960 --> 34:58.280
Fairy Danyin, bad news!

34:58.360 --> 34:59.600
Fairy Danyin!

35:01.480 --> 35:03.080
Lord Changheng offended His Majesty.

35:03.160 --> 35:05.760
He…

35:07.200 --> 35:08.200
What's wrong?

35:09.480 --> 35:10.720
Tell me.

35:10.800 --> 35:12.880
He's sentenced for committing
the crime of collusion.

35:14.800 --> 35:15.760
Seven days later,

35:16.480 --> 35:18.280
he will be executed
at the Immortal Slaying Pavilion.

35:34.600 --> 35:36.280
Big Blockhead, time to take medicine.

35:39.120 --> 35:40.240
You haven't recovered yet.

35:40.320 --> 35:41.960
Why are you using your power again?

35:42.760 --> 35:45.360
I've recovered 60%. I'm fine.

35:45.440 --> 35:47.800
Just 60% and you start to act tough?

35:51.440 --> 35:52.440
Take the medicine.

36:07.200 --> 36:09.200
Are you still worried

36:09.280 --> 36:11.040
about your Hellfire?

36:23.680 --> 36:25.880
In order to purify the primordial spirit,

36:25.960 --> 36:27.880
you've wasted much
of your energy and power.

36:28.520 --> 36:30.600
You need to recuperate first.

36:30.680 --> 36:33.920
We still don't know
how to unseal the soldiers.

36:34.920 --> 36:36.680
If my Hellfire can't be restored,

36:37.400 --> 36:39.720
how can I protect the people
of Cangyan Sea?

37:29.160 --> 37:31.480
I'm afraid I'm going to give birth!

37:32.200 --> 37:35.320
- I'll get someone to deliver the baby!
- You can't go!

37:35.400 --> 37:36.800
I'm a woman from the Moon Tribe.

37:37.720 --> 37:39.080
Our child

37:39.160 --> 37:40.680
can't be found.

37:42.520 --> 37:44.000
- I'm fine.
- Xingluo.

37:44.080 --> 37:45.200
But…

37:46.400 --> 37:47.440
But…

37:47.520 --> 37:49.720
What should we do with our child?

37:50.680 --> 37:53.040
Neither the Moon Tribe
nor the fairies will accept her.

37:53.520 --> 37:54.800
I'm afraid

37:54.880 --> 37:58.040
she'll need to hide all her life.

37:59.120 --> 38:00.880
No, she won't.

38:03.560 --> 38:04.560
Xingluo.

38:04.640 --> 38:06.160
I'm here. Don't be afraid.

38:09.560 --> 38:12.040
- There's a trace of the Moon Tribe nearby.
- Search!

38:25.240 --> 38:26.080
Xingluo.

38:28.720 --> 38:30.280
Xingluo, are you all right?

38:47.400 --> 38:48.880
Lord Ronghao.

38:49.440 --> 38:50.760
She's a member of the Moon Tribe?

38:53.280 --> 38:54.520
Lord Ronghao.

38:54.600 --> 38:57.600
Have you seen a woman of the Moon Tribe
who is about to give birth?

38:57.680 --> 38:58.840
A woman of the Moon Tribe?

39:00.520 --> 39:03.440
I think I saw a pregnant woman
go that way.

39:03.520 --> 39:04.840
Thank you. Let's go.

39:15.120 --> 39:17.040
Thank you for saving our lives.

39:17.640 --> 39:18.960
You should leave now.

39:19.760 --> 39:20.720
Come.

39:32.320 --> 39:34.560
I didn't expect that Ronghao
is the Lord of Haishi.

39:34.640 --> 39:36.560
He's about to be interrogated.

39:36.640 --> 39:38.200
What if he leaks the identity of Danyin?

39:38.280 --> 39:40.240
Father, please save Changheng.

39:42.560 --> 39:43.760
Danyin.

39:43.840 --> 39:45.040
This is…

39:46.040 --> 39:48.120
Father, why do you have something
from the Moon Tribe?

39:50.480 --> 39:52.080
Don't make a fuss.

39:52.160 --> 39:53.880
This is just something I got

39:53.960 --> 39:55.320
when I was on patrol.

39:55.840 --> 39:57.880
Why didn't you submit it
after it was confiscated?

39:57.960 --> 40:00.560
It's a complicated matter. I forgot.

40:01.440 --> 40:03.120
Father, tell me.

40:03.200 --> 40:05.640
Lord Changheng will be executed
in seven days

40:05.720 --> 40:07.360
for committing the crime of collusion.

40:07.440 --> 40:08.560
Is it true?

40:09.360 --> 40:10.320
Yes.

40:13.160 --> 40:14.160
Lord Yunzhong

40:15.800 --> 40:18.480
won't even show mercy to Lord Changheng.

40:20.280 --> 40:21.600
If he knows

40:22.800 --> 40:24.960
you've been keeping stuff
from the Moon Tribe with you,

40:26.960 --> 40:28.160
you'll get in big trouble.

40:33.320 --> 40:34.240
Father.

40:35.000 --> 40:36.640
You must be careful.

40:37.120 --> 40:38.520
My dear daughter.

40:41.000 --> 40:42.120
Don't worry.

40:42.640 --> 40:43.920
I will be fine.

40:44.760 --> 40:46.720
I won't let anything happen to you either.

40:48.000 --> 40:48.840
Father.

40:49.880 --> 40:50.880
What's wrong?

40:55.360 --> 40:56.480
I'm fine.

41:34.680 --> 41:35.840
Xingluo.

41:37.640 --> 41:38.760
I'm sorry.

41:40.280 --> 41:41.920
Not only did I fail to protect you,

41:43.480 --> 41:45.640
but also your only belonging.

41:47.080 --> 41:48.680
But I have no choice.

41:49.600 --> 41:51.160
For the safety of our daughter,

41:52.520 --> 41:55.440
I can't let her identity be exposed.

41:58.920 --> 41:59.840
Xingluo.

42:04.280 --> 42:05.360
I'm sorry.

42:26.840 --> 42:28.640
Why is this Black Dragon's name

42:29.240 --> 42:31.000
so hard to carve?

42:32.760 --> 42:35.520
It's eight times harder than the work
Orchid does for the lord.

42:45.480 --> 42:46.600
Pavilion Master.

42:46.680 --> 42:47.960
Greetings, Pavilion Master.

42:55.200 --> 42:57.280
My lord, I just received a report

42:57.360 --> 42:58.280
of suspicious movement.

42:58.360 --> 43:00.240
I'm afraid someone
has sneaked into the palace.

43:02.240 --> 43:03.120
Go.

43:11.040 --> 43:13.120
Find a chance to drop this blood

43:13.200 --> 43:15.280
on the Bone Orchid worn by Orchid.

43:16.080 --> 43:17.520
Whose blood is this?

43:18.640 --> 43:20.280
Will this hurt Orchid?
